  "details": "Currently, due to spotty or slower internet, worlds will fail their downloads when (presumably) a data packet (or a few) are lost.\n\nThis causes a good number of players to be unable to download worlds on quest or pc due to internet not being stable for long enough. \n\na retry button (like what browsers due with downloaded files) would help players be able to download worlds without being instantly sent back to their home world and kicked out of world hopping social gatherings",
